window.Handbook.register({"id":"ch209","pages":[{"n":1540,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1223\"></span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第209 章RX8010 子系统框架</h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本章介绍RTC 子系统框架。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1224\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">209.1 RTC 子系统框架介绍</h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">RTC 子系统框架如图209.1 所示，分为了用户空间、设备驱动层和硬件层三个层次，其中设备驱动层又包含RTC 设备驱动和RTC 核心层，三个层分别承载了不同的功能。</p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图209.1\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1540-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图209.1\" width=\"969\" height=\"685\"></button><figcaption>图209.1 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">用户空间是应用程序运行层，应用程序通过多种接口与系统交互，例如访问/dev/rtc0 设备节点读写RTC 时间，或通过sysfs 和proc 文件系统来获取或设置硬件状态。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">设备驱动层是连接用户空间与硬件层的核心，他又分为了RTC 设备驱动和RTC 核心层。RTC设备驱动负责硬件操作细节，RTC 设备驱动分为device（设备文件）和driver（驱动程序）两部分，通过/dev/xxx 设备节点与用户空间进行交互。RTC 核心层注册了一个RTC 类用来归类RTC设备，并向RTC 设备驱动序提供了注册和注销接口和基本的RTC 设备操作函数，如open()，read()</p>"},{"n":1541,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">和ioctl 函数等。RTC 核心层也会通过sysyfs 和proc 虚拟文件系统向用户空间提供操作RTC 的接口。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">硬件层为实际的RTC 硬件，RTC 硬件通过I2C、SPI 等接口与设备驱动层通信。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1225\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">209.2 RTC 设备驱动开发</h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">由于RTC 核心层的存在，开发RTC 设备驱动程序对于驱动开发者来说变得十分简单。本章以RTC 芯片RX8010 为例讲解RTC 设备驱动。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1226\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">209.3 RX8010 驱动程序分析</h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">首先在内核源码下打开rk3568-evb.dtsi 设备树文件找到RX8010 对应的设备树节点，该设备节点即RTC 设备驱动的device 部分，具体内容如代码清单209.1 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单209.1</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"6\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">rx8010: rx8010@32 {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    compatible = &quot;epson,rx8010&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    reg = &lt;0x32&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    status = &quot;okay&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    #clock-cells = &lt;0&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1541 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1541\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">compatible 属性通过字符串“epson,rx8010”匹配的驱动为kernel/drivers/rtc/rtc-rx8010.c，该驱动程序即RTC 设备驱动的driver 部分，其驱动的入口函数如代码清单209.2 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单209.2</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"1\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">module_i2c_driver(rx8010_driver);</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1541 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1541\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">module_i2c_driver 宏负责简化i2c 设备驱动的注册和注销流程，定义在include/linux/i2c.h文件中，具体内容如代码清单209.3 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单209.3</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"3\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">#define module_i2c_driver(__i2c_driver) \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">          module_driver(__i2c_driver, i2c_add_driver, \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">              i2c_del_driver)</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1541 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1541\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">其中module_driver 宏同样负责代码的简化，宏定义如代码清单209.4 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单209.4</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"1\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">#define module_driver(__driver, __register, __unregister, ...) \\</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1541 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1541\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1542,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"2\" data-end=\"11\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">static int __init __driver##_init(void) \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">{ \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">  return __register(&amp;(__driver) , ##__VA_ARGS__); \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">} \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">module_init(__driver##_init); \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">static void __exit __driver##_exit(void) \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">{ \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">  __unregister(&amp;(__driver) , ##__VA_ARGS__); \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">} \\</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">module_exit(__driver##_exit);</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1542 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1542\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">最后来对上述宏进行带入，展开内容如代码清单209.5 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单209.5</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"11\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static int __init rx8010_driver_init(void)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return i2c_add_driver(&amp;rx8010_driver);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">module_init(rx8010_driver_init);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">static void __exit rx8010_driver_exit(void)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    i2c_del_driver(&amp;rx8010_driver);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">module_exit(rx8010_driver_exit);</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1542 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1542\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">初始化函数rx8010_driver_init()在模块加载时被调用，它通过i2c_add_driver 函数将rx8 010_driver 结构体注册到内核中。模块卸载函数rx8010_driver_exit()在模块卸载时被调用，它通过i2c_del_driver 函数将rx8010_driver 结构体从内核中注销。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">当RTC 设备驱动的device 部分和driver 部分匹配成功之后会进入到driver 部分中的rx8010_probe()函数，其具体内容如代码清单209.6 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单209.6</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"11\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static int rx8010_probe(struct i2c_client *client,const struct i2c_device_id *id)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct i2c_adapter *adapter = to_i2c_adapter(client-&gt;dev.parent);// 获取i2c 控制器</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const struct rtc_class_ops *rtc_ops; // RTC 操作函数指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rx8010_data *rx8010; // 用于存储设备私有数据的结构体</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int err = 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 检查i2c 适配器是否支持所需的SMBus 功能</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!i2c_check_functionality(adapter, i2c_FUNC_SMBUS_BYTE_DATA</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">        | i2c_FUNC_SMBUS_i2c_BLOCK)) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;adapter-&gt;dev, &quot;doesn&#x27;t support required functionality\\n&quot;);</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1542 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1542\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1543,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"12\" data-end=\"55\" data-contiguous=\"true\" data-recovered=\"pdf-text\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -EIO;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 分配内存以存储设备私有数据</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">rx8010 = devm_kzalloc(&amp;client-&gt;dev, sizeof(struct rx8010_data),</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">                             GFP_KERNEL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">if (!rx8010)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return -ENOMEM;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 初始化设备私有数据</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">rx8010-&gt;client = client;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">i2c_set_clientdata(client, rx8010);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 初始化  RX8010 设备</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">err = rx8010_init_client(client);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">if (err)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return err;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 检查设备是否提供了中断号</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">if (client-&gt;irq &gt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_info(&amp;client-&gt;dev, \"IRQ %d supplied\\n\", client-&gt;irq);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 请求线程化的中断处理程序</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">        err = devm_request_threaded_irq(&amp;client-&gt;dev, client-&gt;irq, NULL,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                          rx8010_irq_1_handler,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                          IRQF_TRIGGER_LOW | IRQF_ONESHOT,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                          \"rx8010\", client);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (err) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, \"unable to request IRQ\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 return err;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><span class=\"source-line\">        }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><span class=\"source-line\">        // 如果有中断支持，使用带有报警功能的  RTC 操作函数</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><span class=\"source-line\">        rtc_ops = &amp;rx8010_rtc_ops_alarm;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><span class=\"source-line\">} else {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><span class=\"source-line\">        rtc_ops = &amp;rx8010_rtc_ops_default; // 如果没有中断支持，使用默认的  RTC 操作函数</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50</span><span class=\"source-line\">// 注册  RTC 设备</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">rx8010-&gt;rtc = devm_rtc_device_register(&amp;client-&gt;dev, client-&gt;name,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52</span><span class=\"source-line\">                                                rtc_ops, THIS_MODULE);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53</span><span class=\"source-line\">if (IS_ERR(rx8010-&gt;rtc)) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(&amp;client-&gt;dev, \"unable to register the class device\\n\");</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return PTR_ERR(rx8010-&gt;rtc);</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">从原书文字层恢复 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1543\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1544,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"61\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">    rx8010-&gt;rtc-&gt;max_user_freq = 1;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return err;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1544 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1544\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在第5 行定义了一个用于存储RTC 设备私有数据的rx8010_data 结构体变量rx8010，该结构体定义如代码清单209.7 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单209.7</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"5\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct rx8010_data {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct i2c_client *client;  // i2c 客户端</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rtc_device *rtc;     // RTC 设备，用于管理实时时钟功能</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    u8 ctrlreg; // 控制寄存器的值，用于存储或配置RX8010 的控制状态</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1544 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1544\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">其中结构体成员client 是指向i2c client 的指针，因为RX8010 芯片使用I2C5 接口与主机进行通信，因此本身也是I2C 设备。rx8010_data 结构体中的client 成员会保存rx8010 节点转换成的i2c client 结构体,用于与主机进行通信，而rtc_device 结构体表示与RX8010 设备关联的RTC 设备，rtc_device 结构体定义如代码清单209.8 下所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单209.8</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"12\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct rtc_device {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct device dev;        // 设备结构体，用于与设备模型集成</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct module *owner;        // 拥有该RTC 设备的模块</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int id;        // RTC 设备的ID</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    const struct rtc_class_ops *ops;    // RTC 设备的操作函数集</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct mutex ops_lock;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct cdev char_dev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned long flags;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    unsigned long irq_data;        // 中断相关数据</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    spinlock_t irq_lock;        // 用于保护中断数据的自旋锁</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">     .............................</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1544 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1544\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">接着继续分析rx8010_probe()函数，在第26 行通过rx8010_init_client()函数对RX8010 芯片进行初始化和配置，函数内容如代码清单209.9 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单209.9</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"4\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static int rx8010_init_client(struct i2c_client *client)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rx8010_data *rx8010 = i2c_get_clientdata(client); // 获取设备私有数据</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    u8 ctrl[2]; // 用于存储控制寄存器的值</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1544 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1544\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1545,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"5\" data-end=\"39\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int need_clear = 0, err = 0; // 标志位和错误码初始化</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    u8 flag;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 读取RX8010 的FLAG 寄存器值</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    flag = i2c_smbus_read_byte_data(client, RX8010_FLAG);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (err &lt; 0)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return err;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 清除FLAG 寄存器中的VLF（电压低标志位）</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    flag &amp;= ~(RX8010_FLAG_VLF);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">    err = i2c_smbus_write_byte_data(client, RX8010_FLAG, flag);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (err &lt; 0)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return err;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">    /* 初始化保留寄存器，按照数据手册的要求*/</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 写入RX8010_RESV17 寄存器的默认值</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">    err = i2c_smbus_write_byte_data(client, RX8010_RESV17, 0xD8);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (err &lt; 0)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return err;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ...............省略寄存器写入和检查相关代码</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 如果需要清除标志位，则清除AF、TF 和UF</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (need_clear) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\">        ctrl[0] &amp;= ~(RX8010_FLAG_AF | RX8010_FLAG_TF | RX8010_FLAG_UF);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">        err = i2c_smbus_write_byte_data(client, RX8010_FLAG, ctrl[0]);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">        if (err &lt; 0)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\">            return err;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 保存CTRL 寄存器的值，并清除TEST 位</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">    rx8010-&gt;ctrlreg = (ctrl[1] &amp; ~RX8010_CTRL_TEST);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return 0;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1545 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1545\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后返回rx8010_probe 函数继续向下分析，在probe 函数的30-48 行，会根据设备是否提供了中断号来决定RTC 芯片的操作模式，但在iTOP-RK3568 开发板中无论是硬件连接还是在设备树配置中并没有使用中断，所以进入的是第二个判断并执行代码rtc_ops =&amp;rx8010_rtc_ops_default。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">rx8010_rtc_ops_default 为RX8010 实时时钟芯片提供了一组默认的操作函数接口，包括读取当前时间的函数指针、设置当前时间的函数指针以及ioctl 控制功能，具体内容如代码清单</p>"},{"n":1546,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">209.10 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单209.10</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"5\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">static const struct rtc_class_ops rx8010_rtc_ops_default = {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .read_time = rx8010_get_time, // 读取当前时间的函数指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .set_time = rx8010_set_time,  // 设置当前时间的函数指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    .ioctl = rx8010_ioctl,        // 提供额外控制功能的函数指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1546 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1546\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">最后在probe 函数的58 行，使用devm_rtc_device_register()函数注册rtc 设备，该函数定义在drivers/rtc/class.c 文件中，函数具体内容如代码清单209.11 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单209.11</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"22\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct rtc_device *devm_rtc_device_register(struct device *dev,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">                        const char *name,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">                        const struct rtc_class_ops *ops,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">                        struct module *owner)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rtc_device **ptr, *rtc;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 分配设备资源管理器的内存</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    ptr = devres_alloc(devm_rtc_device_release, sizeof(*ptr), GFP_KERNEL);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!ptr)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ERR_PTR(-ENOMEM);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 调用rtc_device_register 注册RTC 设备</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    rtc = rtc_device_register(name, dev, ops, owner);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!IS_ERR(rtc)) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">        *ptr = rtc;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">        devres_add(dev, ptr); // 将资源添加到设备资源链表中</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">    } else {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">        devres_free(ptr);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">    return rtc;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1546 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1546\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">该函数的重点在于第14 行的rtc_device_register()函数，该函数同样定义在class.c 文件中，具体内容如代码清单209.12 所示：</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单209.12</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"5\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">struct rtc_device *rtc_device_register(const char *name, struct device *dev,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">                       const struct rtc_class_ops *ops,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\">                       struct module *owner)</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">{</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rtc_device *rtc; // RTC 设备结构体指针</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1546 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1546\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1547,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"6\" data-end=\"49\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单 · 跨页续接</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">    struct rtc_wkalrm alrm; // 用于存储报警信息</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">    int id, err;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 获取一个唯一的RTC 设备ID</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">    id = rtc_device_get_id(dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">11</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (id &lt; 0) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">12</span><span class=\"source-line\">        err = id;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">13</span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto exit;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">14</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">15</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">16</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 分配RTC 设备结构体</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">17</span><span class=\"source-line\">    rtc = rtc_allocate_device();</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">18</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!rtc) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">19</span><span class=\"source-line\">        err = -ENOMEM;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">20</span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto exit_ida;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">21</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">22</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">23</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 初始化RTC 设备的基本属性</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">24</span><span class=\"source-line\">    rtc-&gt;id = id;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">25</span><span class=\"source-line\">    rtc-&gt;ops = ops;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">26</span><span class=\"source-line\">    rtc-&gt;owner = owner;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">27</span><span class=\"source-line\">    rtc-&gt;dev.parent = dev;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">28</span><span class=\"source-line\">    dev_set_name(&amp;rtc-&gt;dev, &quot;rtc%d&quot;, id);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">29</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">30</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 获取RTC 设备的时间偏移量</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"source-line\">    rtc_device_get_offset(rtc);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">32</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">33</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 检查硬件中是否已经设置了报警</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">34</span><span class=\"source-line\">    err = __rtc_read_alarm(rtc, &amp;alrm);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">35</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (!err &amp;&amp; !rtc_valid_tm(&amp;alrm.time)) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">36</span><span class=\"source-line\">        rtc_initialize_alarm(rtc, &amp;alrm);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">37</span><span class=\"source-line\">    }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">38</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">39</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 准备RTC 设备的字符设备接口</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</span><span class=\"source-line\">    rtc_dev_prepare(rtc);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">41</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">42</span><span class=\"source-line\">    // 将RTC 设备的字符设备和设备结构体添加到内核</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">43</span><span class=\"source-line\">    err = cdev_device_add(&amp;rtc-&gt;char_dev, &amp;rtc-&gt;dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">44</span><span class=\"source-line\">    if (err) {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">45</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_warn(&amp;rtc-&gt;dev, &quot;%s: failed to add char device %d:%d\\n&quot;,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">46</span><span class=\"source-line\">             name, MAJOR(rtc-&gt;dev.devt), rtc-&gt;id);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">47</span><span class=\"source-line\">        put_device(&amp;rtc-&gt;dev);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">48</span><span class=\"source-line\">        goto exit;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">49</span><span class=\"source-line\">    } else {</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1547 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1547\">核对原页</button></p></div>"},{"n":1548,"html":"<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"67\" data-contiguous=\"true\" data-recovered=\"pdf-text\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">50</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 dev_dbg(&amp;rtc-&gt;dev, \"%s: dev (%d:%d)\\n\", name,</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">                         MAJOR(rtc-&gt;dev.devt), rtc-&gt;id);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">52</span><span class=\"source-line\">        }</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">53</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">54</span><span class=\"source-line\">        rtc_proc_add_device(rtc);// 将  RTC 设备添加到  proc 文件系统中</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">55</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_info(dev, \"rtc core: registered %s as %s\\n\",</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">56</span><span class=\"source-line\">                   name, dev_name(&amp;rtc-&gt;dev));</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">57</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">58</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return rtc; // 返回注册成功的  RTC 设备指针</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">59</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">60</span><span class=\"source-line\">exit_ida:</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">61</span><span class=\"source-line\">        ida_simple_remove(&amp;rtc_ida, id);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">62</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">63</span><span class=\"source-line\">exit:</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64</span><span class=\"source-line\">        dev_err(dev, \"rtc core: unable to register %s, err = %d\\n\",</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65</span><span class=\"source-line\">                 name, err);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">66</span><span class=\"source-line\">        return ERR_PTR(err);</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">67</span><span class=\"source-line\">}</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">从原书文字层恢复 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1548\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">rtc_device_register()函数的主要作用是注册一个RTC 设备到Linux 内核中，并完成一系列初始化和资源分配工作。该函数的重点在第43 行的cdev_device_add()函数，cdev_device_add()函数将RTC 设备以字符设备的方式注册到内核中，然后是第54 行的rtc_proc_add_device()函数，rtc_proc_add_device()函数将RTC 设备的信息添加到了proc 子系统当中，便于在用户空间调试和监控。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">至此，关于RX8010 驱动源码分析就完成了。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1227\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">209.4 RTC 设备驱动移植</h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">RTC 设备一般都有现成的驱动程序，所以无需重新造轮子，本节以RX8010 为例，讲解如何移植RTC 设备驱动。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">在iTOP-RK3568 开发板底板原理图中，RX8010 芯片电路部分如图209.2 所示：</p>"},{"n":1549,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图209.2\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1549-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图209.2\" width=\"973\" height=\"514\"></button><figcaption>图209.2 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">通过原理图可以确定RX8010 挂载到了i2c5 上，所以需要在设备树的i2c5 节点下添加rx8010的节点，添加内容如代码清单209.13 所示。该设备节点对应RTC 设备驱动的device 部分。</p>\n<p class=\"caption\">代码清单209.13</p>\n<div class=\"code-box\" data-start=\"1\" data-end=\"10\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><div class=\"code-bar\"><span>代码清单</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code\">复制代码</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span class=\"source-line\">&amp;i2c5 {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span class=\"source-line\">    status = &quot;okay&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span class=\"source-line\"></span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4</span><span class=\"source-line\">    rx8010: rx8010@32 {</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5</span><span class=\"source-line\">        compatible = &quot;epson,rx8010&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6</span><span class=\"source-line\">        reg = &lt;0x32&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</span><span class=\"source-line\">        status = &quot;okay&quot;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</span><span class=\"source-line\">        #clock-cells = &lt;0&gt;;</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">9</span><span class=\"source-line\">    };</span></span><span class=\"code-line\"><span class=\"line-no\" aria-hidden=\"true\">10</span><span class=\"source-line\">};</span></span></code></pre><p class=\"code-note\">原书第 1549 页 · 行号不参与复制 · <button type=\"button\" data-original=\"1549\">核对原页</button></p></div>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">第6 行的reg 属性表示RX8010 的地址为0x32，该地址可以根据RX8010 数据手册得到，如图209.3 所示：</p>"},{"n":1550,"html":"<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图209.3\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1550-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图209.3\" width=\"971\" height=\"360\"></button><figcaption>图209.3 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">通过图209.3 中可知从设备地址占字节的高7 位（bit 7 到bit 1）即0110010，换算为16进制得到0x32。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">然后来到Linux 内核源码的根目录，使用以下命令进入menuconfig 界面。export ARCH=arm64 make rockchip_linux_defconfig make menuconfig</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">打开之后如图209.4 所示。</p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图209.4\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1550-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图209.4\" width=\"974\" height=\"385\"></button><figcaption>图209.4 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">进到如下所示路径中。&gt; Device Drivers</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">&gt; Real Time Clock</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">&lt;*&gt;</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">Epson RX8010SJ</p>"},{"n":1551,"html":"<p class=\"body-copy\">图209.5 默认已经勾选了RX8010 设备驱动（driver 部分）对应的配置项，如果没有勾选，需要勾选上，勾选完成如图209.5 所示。</p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图209.5\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1551-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图209.5\" width=\"972\" height=\"242\"></button><figcaption>图209.5 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">除此之外还要确保RK809 电源管理芯片的内部RTC 没有被勾选，确保系统里面不会存在两个RTC 设备，避免发生冲突，RK809 电源管理芯片的内部RTC 对应的驱动程序配置项在make menuconfig 中路径如图209.6 所示。</p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图209.6\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1551-fig02.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图209.6\" width=\"973\" height=\"310\"></button><figcaption>图209.6 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">配置完成后，使用cp .config arch/arm64/configs/rockchip_linux_defconfig 命令将修改之后的配置文件覆盖默认配置文件，然后重新编译烧写内核即可将RX8010 驱动程序编译进内核。至此RX8010 驱动移植完成，因为直接使用的是内核提供的驱动程序，所以移植工作重点在设备树中的设备节点编写上。</p>"},{"n":1552,"html":"<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1228\"></span><h2 class=\"book-heading\">第210 章时间命令讲解</h2>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">本章将会对Linux 系统中查看和设置系统时间的date 命令和负责访问和管理硬件时钟的hwclock 命令进行讲解。</p>\n<span class=\"bookmark-anchor\" id=\"b1229\"></span><h3 class=\"book-heading\">210.1 date 命令</h3>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">date 命令可以查看当前的系统时间，还可以设置系统时间、格式化日期和时间的输出、解析时间字符串并进行时间计算。下面对date 命令的常用功能进行演示。(1)显示当前日期和时间</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">直接运行date 命令会显示当前系统的日期和时间，格式为默认的本地时间格式，如图210.1所示：</p>\n<figure class=\"book-figure\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"zoom-image\" aria-label=\"放大图210.1\"><img src=\"3568阅读资源/figures/p1552-fig01.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"图210.1\" width=\"973\" height=\"83\"></button><figcaption>图210.1 · 点击放大</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">图210.1 中的显示结果含义如下。</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">Thu：星期几（Thursday）</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">Feb：月份（February）</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">20：日期</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">14:42:26：时间（小时:分钟:秒）</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">CST：时区（China Standard Time）</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">2025：年份(2) 设置系统时间</p>\n<p class=\"body-copy\">使用date 命令可以设置系统时间,命令格式：date [MMDDhhmm[[CC]YY][.ss]]。其中，MM表示月份（两位数字，如10 表示十月）。DD 表示日期（两位数字，如30 表示30 日）。hh表示小时（24 小时制，两位数字，如14 表示下午2 点）。mm 表示分钟（两位数字，如23表示23 分钟）。CC 表示世纪（可选，两位数字，如20 表示2000 年代）。YY 表示年份（两位数字，如23 表示2023 年）。.ss 表示秒数（可选，两位数字，如.45 表示45 秒）。</p>"}]});
